{
  "summary": "This experiment tested replacing the scvi_n200 RNA encoder with scgpt in a multimodal setup using imagenet_vit_l image encoder, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion. Validation accuracy (0.520) and F1 (0.479) significantly dropped compared to the top-performing configuration (config_039, 0.725), suggesting scgpt may underperform in this multimodal context. The role of scgpt's architecture or compatibility with other components remains uncertain without direct comparisons to alternative encoders or configurations."
}

